      "title": "Swedish Meatballs (Köttbullar)",
      "description": "Tender, lightly spiced meatballs in a creamy gravy—the dish that defines Swedish home cooking.",
      "prepTime": 25,
      "cookTime": 30,
      "servings": 6,
      "source": "Swedish-American immigrant tradition",
