      "id": "scandinavian-heritage-002",
      "title": "Danish Aebleskiver",
      "description": "Puffy, spherical pancakes traditionally filled with apple and dusted with powdered sugar.",
      "prepTime": 20,
      "cookTime": 20,
      "servings": 24,
      "source": "Danish-American immigrant tradition",
      "story": "Aebleskiver ('apple slices') were traditionally made with apple pieces inside, though plain versions became common. Danish communities in California and the Midwest hold aebleskiver festivals celebrating this beloved treat.",
